{"version":1,"content":"<p>上星期有傳3位男星Callum Turner、Jack Lowden與Josh O’Connor近日為新占士邦一角作最後試鏡，而有英國傳媒就踢爆原來還有一名英國男演員爭奪角色，由於沒有透露該演員身分，因此而惹來大批「邦迷」作揣測。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:16.197208+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.131972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.131972+00:00","content_hash":"83cf2072d401a5d378a6ea99a75b33c678a4e713939c632ddb87f9925fb2d391","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}